{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is nearby, grab it, else search for it. Check object, then do task. Move.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = DoTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = IsAtDestination    />",
